MODULE: media/library
FILES: src/app/api/media/route.ts
RESPONSIBILITY: GET /api/media — lists uploaded images with metadata for admin media gallery
KEY_FILES:
- src/app/api/media/route.ts: media listing endpoint, 42 lines, low complexity
DEPENDENCIES:
- uses: next-auth: getServerSession for admin auth
- uses: fs/promises: readdir, stat for directory scanning
- imports: src/lib/auth: authOptions
INTERFACES:
- GET /api/media: returns array of { filename, url, size, createdAt } sorted by newest first
TRAPS:
- [LOW] Empty or missing uploads dir returns empty array (catches ENOENT) | FIX: try/catch around readdir returns []
DECISIONS:
- Scan filesystem directly instead of database — no schema change needed for file metadata
- Sort by birthtime descending — newest uploads appear first
CHANGELOG:
- F-010 | add: initial media listing API
